Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.02,0:00:04.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  你在家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, good, you're home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.73,0:00:06.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  你得帮我埋个尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, you got to help me bury a body.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.80,0:00:09.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.77,0:00:10.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他的真名是鲁弗斯·特纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}His real name's Rufus Turner.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.33,0:00:11.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,猎魔人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.16,0:00:12.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你的老友吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of your old friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.12,0:00:13.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你见过这个男人吗  -没\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have you seen this man? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.56,0:00:15.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没要你帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't asking for no help.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.23,0:00:16.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没见过这个傻叉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never seen that dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.42,0:00:18.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没征求你的允许\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not asking for your permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.15,0:00:19.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你怎么知道他是个傻叉  -我猜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How you know he's a dick? - Lucky guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.91,0:00:20.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想我了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.65,0:00:21.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每次我们一起埋尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}He always used to pull
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.72,0:00:24.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他总是用老套的\N{\fnArial\fs30}the old "can't work on the sabbath" card
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.06,0:00:25.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"不能在安息日工作"搪塞我\N{\fnArial\fs30}whenever we had to bury a body.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.96,0:00:27.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,教了我一些关于\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taught me a thing or two about...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.57,0:00:28.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,世间邪恶生物的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}what's really out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.79,0:00:30.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很快  我们就一起上路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty soon, we were riding together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.65,0:00:32.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一起合作了多年\N{\fnArial\fs30}worked like that for years,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.22,0:00:34.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有点像你们俩小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}kind of like you two knuckleheads.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.07,0:00:35.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像以前一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like old times.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.50,0:00:37.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我开车就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long as I get to drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.47,0:00:39.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.59,0:00:41.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.73,0:00:50.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(密执根州  大急流城)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.49,0:00:56.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没生气  亲爱的  我就是忙不过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not mad, honey. I'm just outnumbered.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.84,0:00:59.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这地方的状况比我们预期的差多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is way more of a fixer-upper than we thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.63,0:01:00.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我开始明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, I'm starting to see
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.88,0:01:03.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这房子为什么那么久没卖出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}why it was on the market for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.80,0:01:05.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我知道  你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I know. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.97,0:01:07.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说得对  一个个房间的来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right. One room at a time...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.10,0:01:11.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,先从这难看的墙纸开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starting with this awful wallpaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.80,0:01:13.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.28,0:01:15.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  我也爱你  玛雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, love you, too. Love you, too, Maya.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.81,0:01:16.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.66,0:01:29.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.16,0:01:36.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-凯特  -妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kat?! - Mommy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.82,0:01:39.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,房子里有不好的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something... something bad is in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.64,0:01:41.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就是做恶梦了  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was just a nightmare, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.34,0:01:43.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我听到了脚步声\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I heard footsteps.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.15,0:01:45.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们为什么非要搬来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did we have to move here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.26,0:01:49.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我房间为什么这么冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why is it so cold in my room?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.10,0:01:50.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  这里真是挺冷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it is cold in here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.96,0:01:55.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但炉子明天就能修好  所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the furnace is going to be fixed tomorrow, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.44,0:01:58.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你得耐心点  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just got to be patient, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.73,0:01:59.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.54,0:02:03.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-还需要点什么吗  -我渴了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can I get you anything? - I'm thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.70,0:02:06.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  马上给你拿杯水上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, one glass of water coming right up,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.09,0:02:08.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后就继续睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then back to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.48,0:02:09.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.36,0:02:11.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.26,0:02:39.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.01,0:02:59.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第11季第16集]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.34,0:03:05.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.48,0:03:05.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.68,0:03:06.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿玛拉全无消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing on Amara.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.22,0:03:08.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小卡也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing on Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.17,0:03:14.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别泄气  我们会赢的  记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your head up. We're gonna win this, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.92,0:03:17.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  但那是两周毫无进展之前的自信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that was before two weeks of squat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.07,0:03:19.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没人说会轻松的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, look, nobody said it was gonna be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.42,0:03:21.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你懂的  我们现在先猎魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the drill... meantime, we hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.26,0:03:22.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.50,0:03:27.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,绯村直树说她的女儿被什么灵体袭击了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naoki Himura said her little girl was attacked by an entity.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.84,0:03:29.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-孩子陷入昏迷了  -是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kid's in a coma? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.84,0:03:32.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,唯一的伤痕  被妈妈称为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only sign of trauma is what the mom is describing as a
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.43,0:03:34.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是据信袭击者留下的手印\N{\fnArial\fs30}handprint from the alleged attacker,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.43,0:03:36.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但当时屋内没有别人  所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}but no one else was in the house at the time, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.36,0:03:38.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,复仇鬼魂  恶作剧鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}So a vengeful spirit, poltergeist?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.71,0:03:41.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,值得一探究竟  就几小时的路程\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's worth finding out. It's only a couple hours away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.25,0:03:43.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真觉得我们现在应该放弃主要目标吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think now is the time to take our eye off the prize?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.72,0:03:46.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我们不能干等线索出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, we can't just sit around and... and wait for a lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.44,0:03:48.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再说  能办成点事也不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus, it'd be nice to get a win.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.53,0:03:49.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这案子似乎没什么难度\N{\fnArial\fs30}This case seems like a layup.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.87,0:03:52.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,得了  我们什么时候办过没难度的案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, when was the last time we had a layup?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.51,0:04:00.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我妻子在努力赶回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wife is flying back,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.59,0:04:03.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但她的航班在伦敦延误了  所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}but her flight's been delayed in London, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.51,0:04:05.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只能一个人面对\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm alone in all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.21,0:04:09.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会尽力帮助你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we're to help however we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.75,0:04:11.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多谢  但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I appreciate that, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.97,0:04:14.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,联调局为什么要对这种事感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would the FBI have any interest in this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.10,0:04:17.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只是在尽职\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just...doing our due diligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.06,0:04:17.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能不能跟我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? Why don't you go ahead
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.97,0:04:19.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说说袭击当晚的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and tell us about the night of the attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.10,0:04:22.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没人相信发生了袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody believes there was an attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.10,0:04:24.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就连网民都认为我是疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}E-even the internet thinks I'm crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.47,0:04:25.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不那么认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.78,0:04:33.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯特惊叫着醒来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, Kat woke up screaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.45,0:04:36.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为她只是做恶梦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought she was just having a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.18,0:04:40.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但她说她听到了脚步声\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she said she heard footsteps
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.86,0:04:44.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还感觉屋子里有不好的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that she felt something...bad in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.78,0:04:46.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也听到脚步声了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you also hear footsteps?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.63,0:04:47.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.65,0:04:48.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还注意到其他的了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you notice anything else...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.82,0:04:51.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,冷点或灯光闪烁\N{\fnArial\fs30}cold spots or flickering lights?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.16,0:04:53.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还真有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.49,0:04:55.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她房间的灯熄灭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lights were out in her room,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.39,0:04:57.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且很冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}a-and it was cold in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.31,0:04:58.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这意味着什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-what does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.36,0:05:01.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以去你家看看吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you mind if we went and had a look at your house?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.45,0:05:04.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然  如果你们认为这会有帮助的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, yeah, I mean, if you think it's gonna help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.62,0:05:06.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我藏了把钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a-a hide-a-key
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.00,0:05:07.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在前门一块彩石下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}under a painted rock by the front door.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.63,0:05:10.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  多谢帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Thank you for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.45,0:05:11.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.42,0:05:36.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,打扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.10,0:05:37.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么能帮你们的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help you boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.12,0:05:39.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.06,0:05:41.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,赖泽特别探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Special Agent Rizer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.85,0:05:43.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这位是我搭档  比恩特别探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my partner, Special Agent Bean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.76,0:05:44.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我们  -为什么联调局\N{\fnArial\fs30} - We, uh... - Why do the FBI
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.84,0:05:46.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老跑来看那栋房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}keep coming back to that house?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.83,0:05:48.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.60,0:05:51.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,个把年前  联调局就来过\N{\fnArial\fs30}A handful of years ago, the FBI came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.16,0:05:53.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是邻里联防队的队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the head of the neighborhood watch, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.52,0:05:55.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我问过那两位探员是来做什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I asked the two agents what they were doing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.89,0:05:57.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们怎么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what'd they say?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.30,0:05:58.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么都没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.18,0:06:01.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是我见过的最粗鲁的两个人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were two of the rudest people I'd ever met.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.97,0:06:05.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这两位探员会不会是\N{\fnArial\fs30}By any chance, were these agents, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.56,0:06:07.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比较年长的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}elder statesmen?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.45,0:06:09.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.92,0:06:11.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们的朋友吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friends of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.93,0:06:19.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(个把年前)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.61,0:06:34.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么睡在车里  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you sleeping in your car, Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.56,0:06:35.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在是午休时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's lunchtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.09,0:06:41.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,叫我来干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell am I doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.54,0:06:43.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要帮我办案\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're helping me with a case...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.29,0:06:44.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在电话里不是说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I told you on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.79,0:06:46.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.07,0:06:51.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天启即将到来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The apocalypse is on the horizon,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.66,0:06:53.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还要来捉鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you want to hunt a damn ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.37,0:06:55.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除非你小憩的时候想到如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, unless you found a way to stop the end of the world
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.89,0:06:59.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阻止世界末日了  我们在那事上毫无进展\N{\fnArial\fs30}during your little siesta, we got Jack all on any of that business.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.48,0:07:02.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你就在这附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I knew you were in the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.85,0:07:04.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听说这里可能有案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heard about this possible little gig...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.21,0:07:06.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得能办成点事也不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought a win would be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.81,0:07:07.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.40,0:07:10.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是你的后援吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm supposed to be your friggin' backup?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.60,0:07:11.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.72,0:07:12.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你对"后援"的理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if by "backup" you mean
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.93,0:07:15.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我看着你把脏活儿累活都干了的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}you do all the heavy lifting while I watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.39,0:07:17.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天是安息日\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-it's shabbat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.12,0:07:20.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你开玩笑吗  -绝对不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you serious? - Deadly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.41,0:07:23.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还开车过来了呢  这就不违反教规了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You drove over here! Ain't that against the rules?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.36,0:07:25.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,少说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Less talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.76,0:07:26.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多猎魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}More hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.33,0:07:29.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,打扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.81,0:07:32.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们来这儿做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gentlemen... here for?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.45,0:07:34.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,联调局  女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}FBI, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.90,0:07:36.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,特别探员里格斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Special Agent Riggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.26,0:07:37.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我搭档  特别探员莫陶\N{\fnArial\fs30}My partner, Special Agent Murtaugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.73,0:07:39.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们来办联调局公务\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on official FBI business.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.61,0:07:40.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不用担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.96,0:07:44.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是这里的邻里联防队队长  先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I am in charge of the neighborhood watch here, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.54,0:07:48.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要知道你们究竟是来办什么公务的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would like to know what this official business is you're here about.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.52,0:07:51.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是与你无关的公务  女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's officially none of your damn business, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.43,0:07:56.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有好声好气过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you ever nice?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.42,0:07:59.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,1985年  这辈子最糟的一年\N{\fnArial\fs30}1985... worst year of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.54,0:08:57.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里到处有反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting hits everywhere down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.16,0:08:58.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,楼上也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, upstairs, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.23,0:09:00.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那么怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.35,0:09:02.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比和鲁弗斯当年在这儿办过案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby and Rufus worked a case here back in the day?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.87,0:09:04.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们以前遇到过多鬼宅\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we've had houses with multiple ghosts before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.69,0:09:05.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不对劲  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.03,0:09:08.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这世界是小  但也没那么小\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, the world is small, but it's not that small.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.04,0:09:09.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我车后箱里有几本鲍比的日记\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got a couple of Bobby's old journals in the trunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.93,0:09:11.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们去翻翻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't we dig into those,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.20,0:09:13.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再查查房子的历史  看看怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}dig into the history of the house, see what's what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.99,0:09:15.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当时是我们搬进来的第一晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was our first night in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.22,0:09:18.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都上床了  然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had all gone to bed, and then
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.66,0:09:21.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我儿子  威尔  他呼救\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will, My son, he called out for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.71,0:09:24.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说他听到了奇怪的声音  像是脚步声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said he heard a strange noise, sounded like footsteps.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.86,0:09:29.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我丈夫和我跑进了他的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband and I ran to his room,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.14,0:09:31.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但等我们到时\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, uh, by the time we got there,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.52,0:09:35.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的孩子已经失去意识躺在地上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}my baby was on the ground unconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.52,0:09:37.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你那晚还注意到别的什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you notice anything else that night...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.43,0:09:40.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,冷点  灯光闪烁\N{\fnArial\fs30}cold spots or lights flickering?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.58,0:09:43.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还真有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.89,0:09:44.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.72,0:09:47.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,威尔的房间很冷  灯也熄灭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will's room was cold, and the lights were out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.08,0:09:50.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,医生不知道他是出了什么问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}The doctors don't know what's wrong with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.98,0:09:52.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除了他脚踝上的奇怪痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apart from the strange mark on his ankle
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.95,0:09:54.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有其他外伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's no sign of trauma.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.59,0:09:56.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么叫"奇怪痕迹"\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you mean "strange mark"?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.37,0:09:58.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看上去像手印\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks like a handprint.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.13,0:10:04.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.19,0:10:10.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道附近有什么比较经济的汽车旅馆吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, do you know of any affordable motels in the area?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.24,0:10:16.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(汽车旅馆)
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.10,0:10:18.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get this...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.00,0:10:20.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,经理说几年前有两位联调局探员在这儿住过\N{\fnArial\fs30}the manager said two FBI agents stayed here years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.94,0:10:22.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,图个吉利  我要了一样的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I got the same room for luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.35,0:10:27.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉打扰您读书了  教皇陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry to disturb reading time, your holiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.09,0:10:29.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别跟我搞宗教迫害  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not religiously persecute me, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.57,0:10:31.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me something, man...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.98,0:10:35.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你之前为什么睡在车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}why were you sleeping in your car earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.54,0:10:36.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,警方没有什么进展\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cops got nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.16,0:10:38.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真要不回答我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're really ‭not gonna answer me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.86,0:10:42.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我拿到了地产经纪人的房屋报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I got the realtor's report on the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.33,0:10:45.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你买下房子前  他们有法律义务告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause they legally have to tell you who died in a house
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.11,0:10:46.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁死在那里过\N{\fnArial\fs30}before you buy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.79,0:10:48.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看你多聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you being all smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.01,0:10:50.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, who died?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.32,0:10:54.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,房子里死过两个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were two deaths at the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.48,0:10:56.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,第一个是死于意外  别笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first was accidental... and don't laugh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.77,0:10:59.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个人被鸡骨头噎死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}a dude choked on a chicken bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.44,0:11:00.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,另一个是凶杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the other was a murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.48,0:11:02.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一名男子开枪打死妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man shot his wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.28,0:11:04.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比和鲁弗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Bobby and Rufus were...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.69,0:11:07.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,绝对在这儿找过鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}definitely on a ghost hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.42,0:11:12.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"密执根州  大急流城\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, "Grand Rapids, Michigan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.95,0:11:15.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟混蛋寻找可能鬼魂"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possible ghost hunt with Jackass."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.56,0:11:19.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就这些了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all he wrote?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.31,0:11:21.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  看来鲍比没能完成日记\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I guess Bobby never got around to finishing it...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.30,0:11:22.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,懒散\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slacker.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.69,0:11:25.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么他们要么是在找鸡骨头哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so, they were ‭either hunting chicken bone
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.09,0:11:26.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要么是那个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}or asshat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.80,0:11:27.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个鬼当时就被制服了\N{\fnArial\fs30}One ghost breaks bad back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.96,0:11:29.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,另一个一直蛰伏到现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other's been marinating until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.91,0:11:32.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我认为唯一的问题是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only problem I see is
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.00,0:11:34.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不知道鲍比和鲁弗斯究竟烧了哪具尸骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we don't know what bones Bobby and Rufus burned,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.04,0:11:36.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们可能得挖两个坟\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we might have to... dig up two graves.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.97,0:11:37.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,未必吧  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.72,0:11:39.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得没那么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think there's more to it than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.03,0:11:40.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里面感觉不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean... I mean, something's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.84,0:11:42.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太轻松了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all a little too easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.43,0:11:45.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,简单轻松我也不介意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, easy like Sunday morning works for me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.20,0:11:47.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们赶紧了事  继续去追踪阿玛拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can wrap this up quick, get back to hunting Amara.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.06,0:11:49.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把小卡弄回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get Cass back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.96,0:11:52.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你自己也说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, hey, you said it yourself...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.42,0:11:54.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这案子按说该没难度的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This case is supposed to be a layup, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.93,0:11:58.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  但我虽然不愿承认  你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but, as much as I hate to admit it, you were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.70,0:12:01.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们什么时候办过没难度的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I mean, when have we ever had one of those?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.26,0:12:02.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.21,0:12:03.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得鲍比和鲁弗斯当初\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think Bobby ‭and Rufus wasted any time
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.50,0:12:05.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,浪费时间为这种事争执了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}arguing ‭about this kind of crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.23,0:12:06.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.23,0:12:07.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该死  鲁弗斯  你为什么要把\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, Rufus, why do you have to make
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.87,0:12:09.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么事都想的那么复杂\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything so friggin' complicated?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.76,0:12:11.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么复杂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's complicated?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.38,0:12:13.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是说  不是鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying it's not a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.01,0:12:14.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是貘\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a baku.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.59,0:12:15.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.64,0:12:16.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一种日本\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Japanese...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.36,0:12:21.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道貘是什么  你个蠢蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what a baku is, you dumbass.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.09,0:12:23.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在阿拉斯加一起猎过一只\N{\fnArial\fs30}We hunted one together in Alaska.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.76,0:12:27.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我跟你赌一瓶尊尼威士忌\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I'll bet you a bottle of Johnnie
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.07,0:12:28.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个是貘\N{\fnArial\fs30}that it's a baku.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.57,0:12:30.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那准备去给我买尊尼威士忌吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, get ready ‭to buy me a bottle of Johnnie
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.57,0:12:31.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为这才不是貘\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause it ain't a baku.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.86,0:12:33.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是个鬼  简单明了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a ghost, plain and simple,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.89,0:12:35.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们越早把骨头烧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the sooner ‭we get to burnin' bones,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.79,0:12:37.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也就越早能继续去琢磨\N{\fnArial\fs30}the sooner we can get back to figuring out
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.28,0:12:38.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么拯救世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}how to save the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.93,0:12:40.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧  我们还得挖坟呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, come on. We got diggin' to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.05,0:12:43.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们  我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}"We"? "We"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.33,0:12:45.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要说多少次\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many times ‭do I got to tell you, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.54,0:12:49.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你洗洗这破车不行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would it kill you to ‭at least wash this damn thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.88,0:12:52.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里面闻着像路毙动物炖菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}It smells like ‭roadkill Casserole in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.21,0:12:54.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴  你个白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just shut up, you idjit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.33,0:12:59.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.25,0:13:01.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,灰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.61,0:13:05.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,挖坟肯定有更轻松的方式吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's got to be an easier way to dig graves.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.28,0:13:21.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么停下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you stopping?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.20,0:13:23.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为该你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause it's your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.53,0:13:25.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么该我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What... what my turn?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.64,0:13:28.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  看我的唇形  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, yo, yo, Bobby, ‭Bobby, read my lips, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.42,0:13:30.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能帮你  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot help you, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.60,0:13:31.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天是安息日\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is sabbath.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.97,0:13:35.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太阳已经下山了  给我挖\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is after sundown, so get to diggin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.13,0:13:42.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.11,0:13:51.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  我能问个问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, ‭can I ask you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.86,0:13:53.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要不是关于\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as it's not about...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.73,0:13:55.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我之前为什么睡在车里就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}why I was sleeping in my car earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.77,0:13:58.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你之前为什么睡在车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why were you sleeping in your car earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.42,0:14:06.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这几周以来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been burnin' the midnight oil...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.89,0:14:08.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,经常开夜车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last couple of weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.72,0:14:10.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一连几天不睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up for days...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.90,0:14:13.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想找办法阻止天启\N{\fnArial\fs30}looking for ways to stop the apocalypse.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.02,0:14:15.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,寻找任何线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking for...anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.10,0:14:20.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆和迪恩就处在这事中央\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam and Dean are right in the middle of this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.91,0:14:25.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我担心我的孩子们  鲁弗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm worried about my boys, Rufus.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.51,0:14:26.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.62,0:14:31.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.50,0:14:32.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,熊爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Papa bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.32,0:14:35.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你最清楚的  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know ‭more than anyone, Bobby...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.09,0:14:38.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就算我们找到办法维持世界运转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if we find a way ‭to keep the world spinning...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.58,0:14:42.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也不是每个人都能安全脱身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not everyone's gonna be on that bus ride home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.67,0:14:45.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,牺牲  大局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sacrifice, greater good...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.48,0:14:48.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}all that jazz.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.35,0:14:52.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.12,0:14:57.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,猎魔最老的规矩  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oldest rule of hunting, Bobby...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.06,0:14:58.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能拯救每个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't save everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.21,0:15:11.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.10,0:15:12.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.15,0:15:18.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比一向是个做事彻底的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Bobby always was thorough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.64,0:15:22.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两罐灰  那么我们要找的不是鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two ash cans, which means we're not hunting a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.77,0:15:23.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我早说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.71,0:15:26.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯嗯  你就对了这么一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, you... you were right for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.71,0:15:28.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么我们要找的是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, then, what the hell are we hunting?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.36,0:15:57.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.90,0:15:59.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.62,0:16:02.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  多谢了  好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. I appreciate it. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.49,0:16:03.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-这事以前发生过  -这事以前发生过\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This has happened before. - This has happened before.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.06,0:16:04.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你先说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You first.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.68,0:16:06.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just...come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.81,0:16:07.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,理查德兹医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Richards?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.55,0:16:10.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这位是我的搭档  赖泽特别探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my partner, Special Agent Rizer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.48,0:16:12.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这位是理查德兹医生  她已经退休了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Dr. Richards. Now, she's retired, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.36,0:16:14.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在医院里还有朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still have friends on staff here,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.36,0:16:16.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以当我听说一家有两人\N{\fnArial\fs30}so when I heard that two family members
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.27,0:16:18.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,陷入无法解释的昏迷\N{\fnArial\fs30}had lapsed into unexplained comas,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.38,0:16:20.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就来看看能不能帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came in to see if I could help.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.12,0:16:22.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,之前发生这种事时你也在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you were here when this happened before?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.04,0:16:23.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.51,0:16:27.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当时也有两位联调局探员就案件找过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two FBI agents spoke to me about that case, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.50,0:16:30.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,玛丽·亨德森回家去拿儿子最喜欢的娃娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary Henderson went home to get her son's favorite doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.50,0:16:32.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但之后便不再接听电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}When she didn't answer any calls,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.73,0:16:34.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,于是她丈夫报了警\N{\fnArial\fs30}her husband phoned the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.94,0:16:35.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们发现了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}They found her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.90,0:16:37.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she's...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.29,0:16:38.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟儿子一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same as her son.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.79,0:16:40.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,脚踝上有奇怪痕迹  再没别的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weird mark on the ankle. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.35,0:16:43.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是昏迷了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, it's some kind of coma?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.30,0:16:46.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是没见过这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}None like I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.29,0:16:47.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.14,0:16:51.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们的生命体征衰竭得很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, their vitals are fading rapidly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.18,0:16:53.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果他们不尽快转好\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they don't show ‭some signs of rallying soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.16,0:16:55.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我担心他们会撑不过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm worried we may lose them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.34,0:16:58.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,究竟怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.98,0:17:01.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事  我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened? I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.62,0:17:03.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,第二天  母亲和儿子都清醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The next day, mother and son woke up,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.76,0:17:05.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两人都没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}both perfectly fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.73,0:17:08.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然了  我希望这次也能如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously, I hope the same thing happens here,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.12,0:17:09.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}but these two...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.54,0:17:12.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们的生命体征也在衰竭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their vitals are failing, as well, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.08,0:17:14.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  多谢配合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Thank you for your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.15,0:17:18.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比和鲁弗斯猎的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Bobby and Rufus' case?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.40,0:17:19.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  又回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.63,0:17:21.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管是个什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it was... is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.80,0:17:22.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有什么发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you find?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.94,0:17:23.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟当年发现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I talked to the local P.D....
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.93,0:17:26.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,玛丽·亨德森并送她来这家医院的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The actual cops that found Mary Henderson back in the day
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.28,0:17:27.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当地警察通了话\N{\fnArial\fs30}and brought her to this hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.77,0:17:30.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亨德森夫妇还在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are the Hendersons still around?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.72,0:17:37.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,玛丽·亨德森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary Henderson?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.08,0:17:41.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我们是特别探员  -天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're Special Agents... - Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.63,0:17:44.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又发生了吗  我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it happening again? Am I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.75,0:17:45.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我儿子有危险吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is my son in danger?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.88,0:17:48.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不不  一切都好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. E-everything's... everything's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.00,0:17:50.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们...想跟你谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we... we would like to talk to you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.77,0:17:52.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你儿子经历的那件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}about what happened with your son.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.22,0:17:58.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,紧接着  我就在医院醒来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next thing you know, I woke up in the hospital,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.85,0:18:02.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一位联调局探员告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and one ‭of the FBI agents told me
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.12,0:18:05.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,永远别碰起居室里的墙纸\N{\fnArial\fs30}to never touch the wallpaper in the sitting room.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.33,0:18:07.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有两个人身陷危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two people are in great danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.02,0:18:11.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能记起任何事  任何细节吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-anything you can remember, any little detail...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.02,0:18:13.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.54,0:18:17.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我陷入昏迷时  做了个梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was in the coma, I had a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.21,0:18:18.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,更像是噩梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it was more like a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.80,0:18:19.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.48,0:18:24.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还在房子里  但又不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}like I was in the house, but it wasn't the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.13,0:18:28.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一切都很黑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything was dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.82,0:18:30.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看上去很模糊\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it looked faded.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.28,0:18:32.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,起初  我是一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And at first, I was alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.46,0:18:35.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后我开始看到一些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}but then I-I started to see things.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.97,0:18:37.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你究竟看到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you see exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.22,0:18:39.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.84,0:18:40.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.98,0:18:44.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我闭上眼睛  再睁开的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I closed my eyes, ‭and when I opened them...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.30,0:18:46.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他就不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.27,0:18:49.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想离开  但做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to leave the house, but I couldn't,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.28,0:18:52.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后我就开始看到他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then that's ‭when I started to see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.60,0:18:54.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,幽灵还是什么的  我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spirits or something. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.98,0:18:57.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说了  现在都很模糊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I said, it's all...faded now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.14,0:18:59.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是个噩梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was just... a bad dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.13,0:19:04.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你醒来后发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what happened when you woke up?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.76,0:19:07.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们尽力向前看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we tried to move on, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.62,0:19:10.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我甩不掉那种不舒服的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I couldn't shake the bad feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.21,0:19:12.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们把房子卖掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we put the house up for sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.44,0:19:14.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后房市崩盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, the market crashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.61,0:19:17.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最终  我们不再还按揭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, finally, we just walked on the mortgage...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.81,0:19:21.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以现在我们只能租房  恐怕要永远如此了\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is why we now rent and probably will forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.00,0:19:25.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但毁掉信用也值得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destroying our credit was worth it, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.52,0:19:28.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要能远离那栋破房子就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything to get away from that damn house.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.21,0:19:47.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.26,0:19:49.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.67,0:19:52.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.81,0:20:03.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,认得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You recognize that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.67,0:20:06.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有点印象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vaguely.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.52,0:20:08.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来他们重装修的时候破坏了封印\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like they broke a seal when they were redecorating.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.09,0:20:11.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们究竟在猎什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are we hunting?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.72,0:20:17.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(坠落天使)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.46,0:20:50.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我好像查到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it... I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.49,0:20:56.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噬魂怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}A soul eater?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.23,0:20:58.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.00,0:21:03.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吃灵魂的不死怪物  所以叫这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Undead creature that feeds on souls, hence the name.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.59,0:21:08.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,存活于我们的世界和异世界之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}They exist in a place between our world and another.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.34,0:21:11.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噬魂怪住进一栋房子  随后\N{\fnArial\fs30}a soul eater moves ‭into a house, and once it does,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.55,0:21:14.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,根据传说  便会筑巢\N{\fnArial\fs30}it makes what the lore refers to as a nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.51,0:21:17.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"存在于时间和空间之外的地方"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"A place that exists outside of time and space"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.97,0:21:19.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,巢穴看上去  感觉上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}The nest looks and feels like
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.93,0:21:21.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟噬魂怪所居住的房子很像\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatever house the soul eater is in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.98,0:21:24.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么玛丽陷入昏迷的时候那不是做恶梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Mary didn't have a nightmare when she was in her coma.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.11,0:21:25.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,记得吗  她说她当时在她家里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember, she said that she was in her house
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.41,0:21:27.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但又不是她的家  那是巢穴\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it wasn't her house... she was in the nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.78,0:21:29.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噬魂怪并不存在于这里或那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}The soul eaters aren't really here or there,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.64,0:21:31.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他们可以积蓄足够力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}but apparently ‭they can muster enough strength
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.28,0:21:33.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,将被害人的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}t-to yank their vics' souls
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.24,0:21:35.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从这个世界  拽入他们的巢穴\N{\fnArial\fs30}out of this world and into their nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.55,0:21:36.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,被害人被拽入巢穴后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, as soon ‭as the vic's in the nest,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.80,0:21:39.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们就不在我们的时间空间里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}t-they're outside of our space and time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.63,0:21:41.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, ‭what about Mary, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.38,0:21:42.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看到她死去的丈夫和儿子怎么解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}seeing her dead husband and her son?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.92,0:21:46.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,据说  巢穴会扰乱被害人的神智\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, the nest messes with their victim's head,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.21,0:21:49.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让他们看到所爱之人  让他们的灵魂受折磨\N{\fnArial\fs30}shows them things they love, parts of their soul in distress.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.09,0:21:51.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样被害人的灵魂就容易受侵害\N{\fnArial\fs30}It keeps ‭the victim's soul vulnerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.62,0:21:53.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那现实世界的肉身会怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what happens to the meat suits in the real world?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.41,0:21:56.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们会在现实世界里憔悴死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}They wither and die in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.02,0:21:59.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以玛丽和她儿子的生命体征才会衰竭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which explains Mary ‭and her son's failing vitals.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.14,0:22:00.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噬魂怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the soul eater...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.80,0:22:04.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,会关闭巢穴  去下一家\N{\fnArial\fs30}closes up the nest ‭and moves on to the next house.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.44,0:22:07.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那还留在巢里的灵魂呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happens to the remains of the souls in the nest?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.01,0:22:08.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们也会憔悴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they wither, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.94,0:22:11.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但还留在噬魂怪身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they stay with the soul eater,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.59,0:22:13.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让它捕不到猎物时可以享用\N{\fnArial\fs30}keeping it fed in lean times,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.96,0:22:15.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像反刍食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}sort of like a cud.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.45,0:22:20.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,简直太恶心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that sounds perfectly awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.16,0:22:21.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得干掉这混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to kill this bastard
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.32,0:22:23.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,否则亨德森家的俩人要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}before the Hendersons' bodies wither and die.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.73,0:22:26.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,据传说  他们是杀不死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to the lore, they can't be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.47,0:22:29.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我确定  可以困住他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm pretty sure they can be trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.67,0:22:33.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我以前遇到过一次噬魂怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I've faced ‭one of these soul eaters before.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.46,0:22:35.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.42,0:22:37.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是发生在田纳西州古德利茨维尔的一桩案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a case down ‭in Goodlettsville, Tennessee.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.21,0:22:38.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比接到另一名猎人的电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby got a call from another hunter,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.73,0:22:39.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,名叫哈维\N{\fnArial\fs30}a guy named Harvey.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.08,0:22:41.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他当时在猎魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, he was hunting a case.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.04,0:22:44.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,据传房子里满是恶作剧鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}House was rumored to be chock-full of poltergeists.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.23,0:22:45.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他找不到可以烧的骨头\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he couldn't find the bones to burn,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.97,0:22:47.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,于是便叫鲍比去支援\N{\fnArial\fs30}so he calls Bobby for backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.65,0:22:48.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比急忙赶过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby hightails it down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.98,0:22:51.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他拿着猎枪  冲进了房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He goes into the house, buckshots, guns blazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.89,0:22:53.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.53,0:22:56.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别用你的话来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not tell me how you tell it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.88,0:22:58.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我真实情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me how it really happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.69,0:23:01.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一踏进那间房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stepped one foot inside that house
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.55,0:23:03.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就吓尿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and filled my drawers.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.29,0:23:06.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你都能感到那股邪恶感  鲁弗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could feel the badness, Rufus.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.11,0:23:09.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哈维躺在地板上  陷入了昏迷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found Harv on the floor, in a coma.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.99,0:23:11.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想帮他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to help,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.23,0:23:14.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他似乎已经躺了好几天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it looked like he'd been there for days.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.57,0:23:16.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后  我听到了脚步声\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, I heard footsteps.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.17,0:23:19.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我被困住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.06,0:23:23.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我有个古凯尔特符文\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I had this old celtic sigil.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.33,0:23:25.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,算是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sort of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.00,0:23:28.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"紧急情况下打碎玻璃"用的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}"break glass in case ‭of emergency" sort of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.66,0:23:31.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,据说能困住怪物  但老实说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Supposed to trap monsters, but to be honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.44,0:23:33.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那东西以前从未好使过\N{\fnArial\fs30}the damn thing never worked before.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.66,0:23:36.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我只有这一个办法  我就试了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it was all I had, so I started.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.98,0:23:39.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要说这房子感觉不妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this house is bad juju?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.37,0:23:42.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这下感觉更糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just got a hell of a lot worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.19,0:23:45.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等我完成了符文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, I finished the sigil, and once I did,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.05,0:23:46.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,房子又回归正常了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the house went back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.66,0:23:48.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.01,0:23:49.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哈维呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harv?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.99,0:23:53.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他没醒过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He never did wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.31,0:23:59.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.65,0:24:02.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最老的规矩  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oldest rule, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.13,0:24:05.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最老的规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oldest rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.32,0:24:15.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真困住了一个噬魂怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, you actually trapped a soul eater?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.38,0:24:17.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比和鲁弗斯画了个符文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby and Rufus put up their sigil
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.23,0:24:20.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把噬魂怪困在巢里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and trapped the soul eater in its nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.39,0:24:21.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.16,0:24:24.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后它一直待在那里  直到直树不小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and it stayed there until Naoki accidentally
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.60,0:24:26.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在装修的时候破坏了封印的符文\N{\fnArial\fs30}broke the sigil's seal when she redecorated.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.86,0:24:29.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  噬魂怪就被释放了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, which set the soul eater free.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.67,0:24:31.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  但如果符文只是困住了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, but if their sigil only trapped it,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.69,0:24:34.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那玛丽和儿子的灵魂是怎么离开巢穴的\N{\fnArial\fs30}then how did Mary and her son's souls get out of the nest?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.49,0:24:37.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许  封印把灵魂逼出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe the trap forced their souls out?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.30,0:24:38.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.04,0:24:40.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这事肯定没这么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, there's got to be more to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.06,0:24:46.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可惜鲍比和鲁弗斯不能看到这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it's too bad Bobby and Rufus aren't around to see stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.17,0:24:48.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们本会成为很棒的记录者\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'd have been great Men of Letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.44,0:24:51.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  脾气大的老记录者  但是没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, grumpy, old Men of Letters, but, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.40,0:24:53.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.47,0:24:54.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.14,0:24:57.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来记录者有办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like ‭the Men of Letters found a way
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.76,0:24:59.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杀死噬魂怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}to kill soul eaters.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.80,0:25:00.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好厉害  怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome. How?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.89,0:25:02.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来是用另一个符文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, looks like it's another sigil...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.16,0:25:04.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,更复杂一些  血做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}more complicated, uh, made from blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.89,0:25:07.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,割伤手  把符文\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cut your hand, and you paint this bad boy
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.16,0:25:09.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,画在房子里  同时再画一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}inside the house while the same thing is painted...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.39,0:25:12.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在巢穴里\N{\fnArial\fs30}inside the nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.19,0:25:14.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么我们中一个得进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means one of us has to go in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.10,0:25:16.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-嗯  -不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.18,0:25:17.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, dude...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.00,0:25:30.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们再也不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are never settling anything
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.10,0:25:31.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,用那个蠢办法做决定了  再也不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}with that stupid game again... ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.92,0:25:34.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我画在这里  那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I'll paint here, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.93,0:25:35.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}you...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.30,0:25:38.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把你的画在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}paint yours here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.91,0:25:40.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的符文是准备程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, your sigil sets the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.90,0:25:41.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的是必杀技\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine actually kills it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.78,0:25:43.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  血拿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. You got your blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.58,0:25:44.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.52,0:25:48.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-好了  我们来吧  -好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right, let's do this. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.26,0:26:01.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果没记错  接下来要难受了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If memory serves, things are about to get hairy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.83,0:26:03.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要牵着手吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to hold my hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.30,0:26:18.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,继续画  毕加索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep painting, Picasso.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.23,0:27:22.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来抓我啊  你个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come get me, you son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.45,0:27:29.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,离我远点  你个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay away from me, you son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.16,0:27:56.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.12,0:28:00.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.36,0:28:22.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.00,0:28:41.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鲁弗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rufus?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.48,0:28:46.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.33,0:28:58.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you real?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.91,0:29:03.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,威尔·亨德森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will Henderson?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.84,0:29:04.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.69,0:29:06.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有麻烦了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I in trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.93,0:29:09.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不不  孩子  不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, son, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.41,0:29:10.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我叫鲍比·辛格\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Bobby Singer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.68,0:29:13.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm... I'm here to...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.22,0:29:17.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也困在这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm... I'm stuck here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.06,0:29:20.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我会照顾你的  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, uh, I'm gonna take care of you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.70,0:29:22.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看见你母亲了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you seen your mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.46,0:29:24.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.87,0:29:28.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看到什么...奇怪的人了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}H-have you seen anyone...strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.75,0:29:30.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是指那些难过的人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean the sad people?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.51,0:29:32.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}The who?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.40,0:29:33.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们就在你身后\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're right behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.24,0:29:43.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们看上去像是病了  你没看到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They look sick. You don't see them?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.92,0:29:46.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.62,0:29:49.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们会离开这儿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, uh, we're gonna get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.45,0:29:51.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的朋友会帮我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friend is gonna help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.23,0:29:55.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.45,0:30:02.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby? Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.67,0:30:09.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.80,0:30:16.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最老的规矩  鲍比  最老的规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oldest damn rule, Bobby. Oldest rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.71,0:30:17.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.85,0:30:46.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  有我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.88,0:30:48.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,撑住  好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay with me. There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.01,0:30:50.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我老得要做不动这种事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting too old for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.95,0:31:07.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你干什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.93,0:31:13.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是凯特吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Kat, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.54,0:31:15.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,认识你很高兴  凯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nice to meet you, Kat.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.03,0:31:19.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不该跟陌生人说话的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not supposed to talk to strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.26,0:31:23.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是条好规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that... that is a solid rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.12,0:31:28.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我叫迪恩·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Dean Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.15,0:31:31.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧  我不是陌生人了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? Now I'm not a stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.95,0:31:34.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是来带你离开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here to get you out of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.03,0:31:36.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你见到你妈妈了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you seen your mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.30,0:31:37.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看不到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.85,0:31:39.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里现在太挤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too crowded in here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.92,0:31:46.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没看见别人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I don't see anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.05,0:31:47.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你很快就会看到他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll see them soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.75,0:31:51.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我带你离开这儿怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about we get you out of here instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.23,0:32:00.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你妈妈就在这附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mom is around here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.16,0:32:04.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们一起去找她  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll look for her and stick together, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.20,0:32:06.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.55,0:32:10.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  别  我说了我们得一起行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, wait. ‭I said "stick together""
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.36,0:32:13.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.07,0:32:30.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.37,0:32:37.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,打我  你朋友就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot me, you kill your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.29,0:32:41.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,岩盐  鲍比受得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rock salt... Bobby can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.95,0:32:43.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.48,0:32:44.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不必伤害任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No need to hurt anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.00,0:32:46.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟我走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just come along with me...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.11,0:32:48.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,进入巢穴\N{\fnArial\fs30}into the nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.53,0:32:49.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.11,0:32:51.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让你给我看一堆乱七八糟的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you can show me a bunch of messed-up stuff in there
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.41,0:32:53.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,留着我帅气的身躯在外面发霉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}while my fabulous body rots out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.16,0:32:57.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think I want to take that ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.07,0:33:01.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.05,0:33:04.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.24,0:33:07.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不喜欢这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.43,0:33:10.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, me, neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.18,0:33:13.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.67,0:33:16.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他在画一幅跟这个很像的画\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's making a painting just like this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.49,0:33:18.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等他完成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when he's done...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.47,0:33:20.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就能出去了  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're out of here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.58,0:33:24.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点  萨姆  准备好了  我们开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Sam, the table is set. Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.31,0:33:27.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们更多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more of them now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.77,0:33:51.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.51,0:33:53.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能允许你画完  孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't let you finish that finger painting, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.27,0:34:07.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟我进入巢穴吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Just come with me into the nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.06,0:34:09.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以保护你不受黑暗伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can keep you safe from the Darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.47,0:34:11.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  听我说  我知道你还在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, listen to me. I know you're in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.50,0:34:12.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抵抗它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fight this!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.25,0:34:13.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鲁弗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rufus...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.79,0:34:15.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能让你困住我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't let you trap me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.10,0:34:18.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我们就有麻烦了  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, we got a problem then, don't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.47,0:34:34.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, stop this!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.63,0:34:45.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你哥哥想去找黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother wants to go to the Darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.88,0:34:49.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他必须去  但我可以保护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needs to go, but I can keep you safe...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.63,0:34:51.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,永远保护你们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both of you... forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.67,0:35:09.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这可不妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that can't be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.05,0:35:58.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们都走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.00,0:36:31.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby? Bobby?!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.66,0:36:34.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.32,0:36:38.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.57,0:36:43.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.48,0:36:45.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧  你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you good? Are you good?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.77,0:36:47.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  有我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.52,0:37:12.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.06,0:37:14.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家都醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, everybody's awake...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.52,0:37:15.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}And happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.70,0:37:17.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,究竟怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.17,0:37:20.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是个封印咒  我们也该被困住啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a trap spell. We should be trapped, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.39,0:37:22.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是个貘  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a baku, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.75,0:37:24.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我趁你睡觉时杀掉了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed it while you slept.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.46,0:37:26.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你欠我一瓶尊尼威士忌哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'll be ‭one bottle of Johnnie, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.42,0:37:27.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,才不是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't a damn...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.43,0:37:29.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,封印符文把你们的灵魂推了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The trap sigil pushed your souls out.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.86,0:37:31.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结案  不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Case closed. You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.29,0:37:32.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不喜欢这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I don't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.89,0:37:35.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁管你喜不喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who gives a damn what you like?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.02,0:37:36.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,接受胜利吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the win.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.79,0:37:37.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.80,0:37:39.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay, Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.62,0:37:40.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.93,0:37:44.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在巢穴里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw something...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.88,0:37:47.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看到了什么  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the nest, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.63,0:37:51.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看到什么了  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd you see, Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.79,0:37:55.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我那俩熊孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.16,0:37:58.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.83,0:38:00.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both of them dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.91,0:38:01.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后我看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, I saw...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.67,0:38:06.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不知道我看到的是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't know what the hell I saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.19,0:38:08.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.02,0:38:11.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,忘记最老的规矩吧  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget the oldest rule, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.23,0:38:15.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你这是心软了吗  鲁弗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gettin' soft on me, Rufus?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.07,0:38:16.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,软个鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, soft this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.61,0:38:19.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Idjit.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.35,0:38:28.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事  我没事  我特别想回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, I'm okay. I can't wait to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.21,0:38:32.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还是不明白到底是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I still don't understand what the hell just happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.45,0:38:34.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你只需要知道  你的房子现在已经安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you need to know is that your house is safe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.79,0:38:36.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过你家厨房估计得重新装修一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your kitchen may need a remodel, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.35,0:38:39.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事  我们想把房子卖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm, that's okay. I think we're selling.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.92,0:38:40.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.53,0:38:42.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  你多保重\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, take care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.82,0:38:45.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你们...做的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you... for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.21,0:39:10.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(好吧  混蛋  你赢了  享用吧  鲁)
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.15,0:39:23.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  你们没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean. You boys okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.33,0:39:26.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们没事  鲍比  你去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we're fine, Bobby. Where the hell have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.65,0:39:28.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我留了三通留言  -我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I've left three messages. - Well, I was...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.10,0:39:30.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,缅因州有一条疑似莉莉丝的线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I got a possible lead on Lilith in Maine,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.26,0:39:31.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我们在里诺办案\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we're on a case in Reno.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.46,0:39:33.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我把地址短信给你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I texted you the address.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.19,0:39:35.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你闲够了的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, if you're done sitting on your ass...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.28,0:39:45.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,继续午餐回顾  下面是另一首经典金曲\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here's another classic as our flashback lunch continues.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.59,0:39:46.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Idjits.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.45,0:40:08.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.59,0:40:11.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,话说  鲍比的日记里没提到他进入了巢穴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Bobby's journal never mentioned him going into the nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.13,0:40:12.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,实际上  什么都没写\N{\fnArial\fs30}It didn't say anything actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.90,0:40:14.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得那真的是他  还是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think it was really him or...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.56,0:40:16.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.91,0:40:19.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许就像你之前说的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's like... like you said before,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.38,0:40:21.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比和鲁弗斯的封印符文\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Bobby and Rufus' trap sigil
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.17,0:40:23.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当时将他们的灵魂逼出了巢穴\N{\fnArial\fs30}forced their souls out of the nest back then
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.49,0:40:26.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噬魂怪只是让我看到了幻象\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that the soul eater was just making me see things.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.97,0:40:27.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}However...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.27,0:40:31.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果鲍比那时真进了巢穴\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Bobby did go into the nest back then...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.62,0:40:33.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也说过巢穴存在于\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you said that the nest exists
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.94,0:40:36.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,空间和时间之外  那\N{\fnArial\fs30}outside of space and time... then...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.72,0:40:39.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,理论上讲  他和我有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, theoretically, couldn't he and I have been there
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.96,0:40:41.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,同时存在于那里啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the same time? Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.04,0:40:44.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我头疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}My head hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.88,0:40:47.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-那就去喝酒  把这事永远忘记吧  -好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, let's get drunk and not think about this ever again. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.53,0:40:48.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过我们得先去趟田纳西州\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, we got to stop in Tennessee, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.68,0:40:50.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比之前那桩噬魂怪案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby's old soul eater case.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.54,0:40:52.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他不会希望留下悬案  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wouldn't want any unfinished business on the books, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.71,0:40:54.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.25,0:40:56.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但这回换你进巢穴\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this time, you're going in the nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.94,0:41:07.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说噬魂怪让你看见了好多东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you said the soul eater made you see "things," plural.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.28,0:41:10.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还看见了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what else did you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.36,0:41:14.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看见你的尸体躺在地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw you dead on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.81,0:41:17.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.84,0:41:21.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的日子是过得多糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}How messed up are our lives that
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.71,0:41:25.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以至于你看见我的尸体还有点令人欣慰\N{\fnArial\fs30}you seeing a vision of dead me is actually kind of comforting?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.22,0:41:27.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.64,0:41:31.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,接下来是今天最后一首经典金曲\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here's the last classic of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.41,0:41:33.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟"奥曼兄弟乐队"一起上路吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's take it on the road with the Allman brothers.

